            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Some suspected that Mars once harbored life. <br />\r\nThere was a reason that it wasn't ever found.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMines of Mars is a procedural atmospheric mining game that is inspired by games like Metroid and Motherload. <br />\r\nIt is also a story based adventure game with dark secrets, great weapons, tons of different items, and a gorgeous world to explore. <br />\r\nThe world of MoM is procedurally created, so that every time you play it, it will be a little different. <br />\r\nThere are tons of different enemies, dark corridors, and a large variety of fauna and ambient creatures. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Huge Procedurally generated underground world <br />\r\n-Night and Day system <br />\r\n-Dark secrets <br />\r\n-Atmospheric vibes <br />\r\n-3 Mini Games<br />\r\n-Original Ambient Soundtrack by Evan Gipson <br />\r\n-Lots of flora and fauna <br />\r\n-Tons of Weapons and Items <br />\r\n-Great storyline <br />\r\n-Gravity Mining! <br />\r\n-Huge Bosses <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFollow us for the latest info and game news!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n• http://crescentmoongames.com/other-games/<br />\r\n• http://facebook.com/crescentmoongames<br />\r\n• http://twitter.com/cm_games",
